  rm:cpuTimeCalculationMethod "CPU time is the sum of realtime multiplied by %cpu from the Nextflow trace for 280 of 280 task(s). This covers short-lived pods that may finish between Prometheus scrapes. For comparison, Prometheus container_cpu_usage_seconds_total measured 313.947 seconds across 32 of 280 pod(s)." ;
